-- Open Vanilla Classic+: the race/class combinations of modern retail WoW (56 of the 72), for the
-- 8 vanilla races and 9 vanilla classes. Every race can be a Warrior, Hunter, Rogue, Priest, Mage
-- or Warlock; Paladin is Human/Dwarf, Shaman is Orc/Tauren/Troll, Druid is Night Elf/Tauren/Troll.
-- Generated by gen_classicplus.py from stock classic-db (4d230bb): racial spells from the race, class
-- spells from a donor race of the same class. Idempotent: re-running changes nothing.
-- Tauren Paladin and Dwarf Shaman were offered before: like the older retired pairs (end of file)
-- their rows stay only while a character uses them, and openvanilla_closed_combo closes them to new ones.

